WEBVTT

00:00:01.022 --> 00:00:03.743
What could you build with AI in one weekend?

00:00:04.630 --> 00:00:05.472
Come and see.

00:00:05.772 --> 00:00:07.056
Two live sessions.

00:00:07.356 --> 00:00:09.282
One Saturday, one Sunday.

00:00:10.282 --> 00:00:14.912
On day one, we start with how AI works, and set it up to know your work.

00:00:15.212 --> 00:00:17.395
Then a weekly report, in minutes.

00:00:17.771 --> 00:00:21.762
After that, pictures, video and sound, made with AI.

00:00:22.062 --> 00:00:25.772
And skills and connectors, so it can reach your files and your tools.

00:00:26.828 --> 00:00:30.021
On day two, we automate a task you repeat every week.

00:00:30.321 --> 00:00:32.590
Then we build your first agent.

00:00:32.976 --> 00:00:37.430
Give it a goal, and it researches, drafts, and checks its own work.

00:00:37.730 --> 00:00:40.818
And last, a team of agents, working together.

00:00:41.859 --> 00:00:44.688
Everything is built live, step by step.

00:00:44.988 --> 00:00:48.460
Then you get the complete kit, so you can repeat it yourself.

00:00:49.546 --> 00:00:51.228
The AI Weekend.

00:00:51.528 --> 00:00:55.413
Live, online, the last weekend of every month.

00:00:56.077 --> 00:00:57.505
Reserve your seat.

00:00:57.805 --> 00:00:59.959
The link is on the screen.
